# Pin the line ending the working tree gets, on every platform.
#
# `lib/` is generated by `tsc` and therefore always LF, while `core.autocrlf=true`
# on Windows checks everything else out as CRLF — so after every build, every lib
# file `tsc` rewrote showed up as modified with no content change. With `eol=lf`
# the checkout bytes match the build output and the status stays honest.
* text=auto eol=lf
